# ticket 16's whole-corpus render harness builds here so it cannot disturb `dist/`,
# which every other parity check reads.
/dist-parity

# The generated content mirror (ticket 12). It is SPENT — the submodule holds `.mdoc`
# directly since the cutover and `content.config.ts` reads it there, so nothing writes
# this path any more. The rule stays because the cost of the two states is asymmetric:
# forgetting it once would put private content in a public repo, and it very nearly did
# — `git mv astro/src src` carried the old mirror along while its `astro/`-prefixed rule
# silently stopped matching.
/src/content

# agent working files — issue tracker, prototypes and in-flight reviews stay local
/.scratch
/wip